  "notes": "Source Table 13 on page 55 provides Total Lives (counts) and Annual Salaries (totals) by Age and Service. Average salary is derived by dividing Total Salaries by Total Lives. Source table 0 contains the salary totals, source table 1 contains the member counts used as weights for weighted_avg operations where bins are merged (e.g., <25, 70, and service <4). Target row '29' maps to source '25-29', '34' to '30-34', etc. Target col '4' merges 'Under 1' and '1-4'. Target col '40' maps to '35 & Over'.",
